    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/79dd242700118f25dcca277da7d4fc1e.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chicken Express</strong> is an online co-op horror game for 1\u20134 players, featuring physics-based chaos, proximity voice chat, and terrifying monsters. Team up with friends to explore surreal, haunted realms, capture chickens with your gravity gun, and deliver them safely back to the train -before something finds you first.\u00a0Survive together or scream alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/bd33c01fe1a42fec386b6906f3dafc79.poster.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/bd33c01fe1a42fec386b6906f3dafc79.webm?t=1750950947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/bd33c01fe1a42fec386b6906f3dafc79.mp4?t=1750950947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/047e17448e0d318deff794f9b6d41fca.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=80 /></span>\u00a0Gravity guns, throwable objects, chicken cannon madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/ed70d23447624c771d99f60649990738.poster.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/ed70d23447624c771d99f60649990738.webm?t=1750950947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/ed70d23447624c771d99f60649990738.mp4?t=1750950947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/46ab2b26681d63e0b54c74a3653bc054.poster.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/46ab2b26681d63e0b54c74a3653bc054.webm?t=1750950947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/46ab2b26681d63e0b54c74a3653bc054.mp4?t=1750950947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/0a358451f1cf6d8fc33fba3873a8d3e1.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=80 /></span>Hear your friends panic in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/1bc39603778904a068082fe8610e7d7a.poster.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/1bc39603778904a068082fe8610e7d7a.webm?t=1750950947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/1bc39603778904a068082fe8610e7d7a.mp4?t=1750950947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/04017a3bd65bbdc6fc854b252c211f9a.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc40  Each realm is crawling with something... watching. Remember to\u00a0<strong>Use flares to find your way</strong>.\u00a0And try not to get lost in the dark.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/3c22766843a3cb0dca6c5e25cdc676a4.poster.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/3c22766843a3cb0dca6c5e25cdc676a4.webm?t=1750950947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/3c22766843a3cb0dca6c5e25cdc676a4.mp4?t=1750950947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude82 <strong>Hang out in the caf\u00e9</strong> \u2013 Heal up with drumsticks, drink Fast Cola, chat with the Colonel.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/79dd242700118f25dcca277da7d4fc1e.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chicken Express</strong> is an online co-op horror game for 1\u20134 players, featuring physics-based chaos, proximity voice chat, and terrifying monsters. Team up with friends to explore surreal, haunted realms, capture chickens with your gravity gun, and deliver them safely back to the train -before something finds you first.\u00a0Survive together or scream alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/bd33c01fe1a42fec386b6906f3dafc79.poster.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/bd33c01fe1a42fec386b6906f3dafc79.webm?t=1750950947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/bd33c01fe1a42fec386b6906f3dafc79.mp4?t=1750950947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/047e17448e0d318deff794f9b6d41fca.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=80 /></span>\u00a0Gravity guns, throwable objects, chicken cannon madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779960/extras/ed70d23447624c771d99f60649990738.poster.avif?t=1750950947\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/37